OL,4,CNvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang     
OL,5,Cafter affair with alleged spy as Trump 
OL,6,Csays 'I made the deal'                 
OL,7,GUS President Donald Trump says he      
OL,8,G"made the deal" after Nvidia's board   
OL,9,Gvoted unanimously to reinstate Jensen  
OL,10,GHuang as CEO and president.            
OL,12,FHuang stepped down earlier this month, 
OL,13,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman 
OL,14,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -  
OL,15,Fhe was also accused of an affair with  
OL,16,Fan Nvidia executive. Here's a timeline 
OL,17,Fof Huang's downfall - and return.      
OL,19,FNvidia shares have jumped by around    
OL,20,F30% - , writes our business reporter.  
OL,22,                                   G1/2 
