OL,4,CNvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang     
OL,5,Cafter affair with alleged spy as Trump 
OL,6,Csays 'I made the deal'                 
OL,7,FMeanwhile, the US Senate Banking       
OL,8,FCommittee has announced Huang will     
OL,9,Ftestify on 3 December; he's also been  
OL,10,Fcalled to appear before three House    
OL,11,Fcommittees.                            
OL,13,FTrump - who has pushed for Huang's     
OL,14,Freinstatement - calls him a "great     
OL,15,Fpatriot" and says the US government    
OL,16,Fhas "no reason to believe" his return  
OL,17,Fposes a national security risk.        
OL,19,FHuang says: "I take this               
OL,20,Fresponsibility with the greatest       
OL,21,Fhumility and renewed commitment" -     
OL,22,Fread his full statement.          G2/2 
