OL,4,CMy approach to EU is pragmatic, says   
OL,5,CBurnham                                
OL,6,GThe prime minister has said new        
OL,7,Gagreements with the EU are "pragmatic" 
OL,8,Gand "not a prelude to anything", as he 
OL,9,Goutlined his agreement with the bloc   
OL,10,Gto MPs.                                
OL,12,FAndy Burnham told the Commons there    
OL,13,Fwas "no fixed destination" on talks to 
OL,14,Fexplore closer ties with the European  
OL,15,FUnion, adding it would be              
OL,16,F"unthinkable" for the UK to rejoin the 
OL,17,Fbloc without a referendum.             
OL,23,D]CParliament and politics digest...G144
