OL,4,CRussian warship hit by Ukrainian       
OL,5,Cdrones in Libya, Zelensky says         
OL,6,GA Russian warship was sunk by          
OL,7,GUkrainian drones at a port in Libya on 
OL,8,GSunday, President Volodymyr Zelensky   
OL,9,Ghas said.                              
OL,11,FThere was an explosion on the warship  
OL,12,Fat the Benghazi naval base in the      
OL,13,Fearly morning, while it was docking    
OL,14,Ffor fuel and supplies ahead of its     
OL,15,Freturn to Russia, local authorities    
OL,16,Fsaid.                                  
OL,18,FZelensky added that Ukraine's attack   
OL,19,Fhit a second Russian vessel, a cargo   
OL,20,Fship which he claimed was being used   
OL,21,Fto transport weapons.                  
