OL,4,CIsraeli attacks have turned Gaza into  
OL,5,C'toxic wasteland', Oxfam says          
OL,6,GGaza has been turned into "a toxic     
OL,7,Gwasteland", with more than 99% of the  
OL,8,GPalestinian territory showing          
OL,9,Gindicators of environmental            
OL,10,Gcontamination from Israeli military    
OL,11,Gattacks, a new report from the charity 
OL,12,GOxfam says.                            
OL,14,FHeavy metals, explosive residues,      
OL,15,Fasbestos from destroyed buildings, and 
OL,16,Fdioxins and biological contaminants    
OL,17,Fare threats to Palestinians now and    
OL,18,Fpotentially for decades to come, it    
OL,19,Fsays.                                  
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
